    {
      "id": "ref-shang-p01-position",
      "title": "Position: where something is",
      "explanation": "Keep position separate from an action. 楼上 says upstairs; 上楼 describes going upstairs. 床上 is on the bed; 上床 describes getting into bed.",
      "sourcePages": [
        1
